OL,3,GNEWSAFinancial firms could face fee
OL,4,Arise
OL,5,
OL,6,FFinancial firms in Guernsey could be
OL,7,Fcharged 4.3% more in regulatory fees
OL,8,Ffrom 2027 under proposals published by
OL,9,Fthe Guernsey Financial Services
OL,10,FCommission (GFSC).
OL,12,FThe commission said the increase was in
OL,13,Fline with inflation and reflected the
OL,14,Fcost of maintaining effective
OL,15,Fregulation, including investment in
OL,16,Fstaff, technology and specialist
OL,17,Fexpertise.
OL,19,FThe proposals, which are now out for
OL,20,Fconsultation, would apply from 1
OL,21,FJanuary next year if approved.
OL,23,APub: 06-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
