OL,3,GNEWSAFinancial firms could face fee
OL,4,Arise
OL,5,
OL,6,FIn a consultation paper, the GFSC said
OL,7,Fthe proposed increase was "in line with
OL,8,FBailiwick inflation" and was intended
OL,9,Fto ensure it could continue to provide
OL,10,F"effective, high-quality regulation".
